@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# CROWDCOST measurement criterion
+
+DESIGN_PHASE_MEASUREMENT_NOT_A_CLAIM.
+
+The run is complete when one deterministic, single-process harness:
+
+1. regenerates only the frozen 12-anchor development prefix
+   `V025_PROBE/world/1` (steps 0--3 x three carriers);
+2. constructs, at every anchor, an exact mask-minimum beam cover and an exact
+   mask-maximum distinct-beam matching, plus every integer active-beam level
+   between them;
+3. rejects any family row serving fewer PHY users than that anchor's geometric
+   carrier BASE;
+4. evaluates full-buffer decoded bits and partial-payload joules through the
+   production dense `a-r0`/48-boundary path;
+5. runs isolated shared-versus-private experiments for 2, 4, 8, and 16 legal
+   users where the anchor masks permit; and
+6. writes a hash-bound JSON receipt, prints `anchor k/12` progress and peak RSS,
+   and fails unless niceness, interpreter, single-thread pins, and RSS < 5 GB
+   hold.
+

